  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Giả sử khối chóp của đề bài là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giả thiết có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là tâm của đáy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thể tích của khối chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/2c74e19e5336cc5521afba090674b1481ca6bc6b2921249c4554f070f5054128.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
